event: content_block_delta
data: {"delta":{"partial_json":"{\"file_path\": \"/tmp/dev_dispatch_1.md\", \"content\": \"This is your only dispatch for this mission unless rework is requested. Implement exactly the following in the subject repository, on your own branch:\\n\\n1. Create `src/greet.py` containing a function `greet(name)` that returns the\\n   string `\\\"Hello, \u003cname\u003e!\\\"` (i.e. `greet(\\\"Alice\\\")` returns `\\\"Hello, Alice!\\\"`).\\n2. Create `tests/test_greet.py` with unit tests covering:\\n   - a normal name (e.g. asserting `greet(\\\"Alice\\\") == \\\"Hello, Alice!\\\"`)\\n   - the empty string (asserting `greet(\\\"\\\") == \\\"Hello, !\\\"`)\\n3. Run `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests` yourself from the repo root\\n   and confirm it exits 0. Do not report success unless you have actually run\\n   this and seen it pass.\\n4. Commit all changes to your own branch (do not touch any other branch).\\n5. Reply with an honest report: what you implemented, the exact test command\\n   you ran, and its output/exit code. If anything failed or you were unable\\n   to verify something, say so explicitly rather than claiming success.\\n\"}","type":"input_json_delta"},"index":0,"type":"content_block_delta"}

